# spec: GET [1.5] CNC is [steps, step, flags]; 11 steps make a 0-10 scale, so 0b 00 03 reads as level 0 of 10 (NOTES.md read table).
# source: captures/20260404-173258_wind-block.json, snapshot "before" (QC Ultra 2, firmware 8.2.20), [1.5] = 0b0003
device qc_ultra2
call cnc
send 01 05 01 00
recv 01 05 03 03 0b 00 03
result ok 0/10
